cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, the prior atlas or the derived data, please cite the article and this archive."
type: software
title: "AIVC: a mechanistic multi-omics virtual-cell model for cross-lineage perturbation prediction"
abstract: "Code, benchmark harness and falsification scripts for AIVC, a virtual-cell perturbation model built on lineage-invariant low-rank programme gating, leave-one-lineage-out ridge anchoring and cross-modal embeddings. Includes the prior-atlas builders, the sign and component ablations, the equal-data audit and the figure-generation scripts."
